            <Box style={{ width: 1020, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>图纸不等于答案</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>地图、语义与碰撞各司其职，公开空间语义里不写「谁该去哪个窗口」。</Text>
